				<r3d:description language="eng">The CosmoSim database provides results from cosmological simulations performed within different projects: the MultiDark and Bolshoi project, and the CLUES project. 
The CosmoSim webpage provides access to several cosmological simulations, with a separate database for each simulation. Simulations overview: https://www.cosmosim.org/cms/simulations/simulations-overview/ .
CosmoSim is a contribution to the German Astrophysical Virtual Observatory.</r3d:description>
